graph TB
    Start([Input: Broadcast Video<br/>News/Parliament with SLI]) --> Init[Initialize System<br/>OpenCV VideoCapture<br/>Extract: Resolution, FPS, Duration]
    
    Init --> Detection{Auto Detection Mode}
    
    Detection --> Border[Border Detection Method<br/>HSV Color Space Analysis<br/>Morphological Operations]
    Border --> BorderCheck{Confidence > 0.25?}
    BorderCheck -->|Yes| BorderResult[✓ Border Detected<br/>Light-colored frame found]
    BorderCheck -->|No| Hybrid[Hybrid Detection<br/>Motion + Edge Fallback]
    
    Hybrid --> Motion[Motion Analysis<br/>Optical Flow - Farneback<br/>Accumulate motion heatmap]
    Motion --> MotionCheck{Confidence > 0.6?}
    MotionCheck -->|Yes| MotionResult[✓ Motion Detected<br/>High-frequency movement]
    MotionCheck -->|No| Edge[Edge Detection<br/>Canny Edge Detector<br/>Contour Analysis]
    
    Edge --> EdgeResult[✓ Edge Detected<br/>Rectangular overlay found]
    
    BorderResult --> Result[Detection Result<br/>Bounding Box: x1,y1,x2,y2<br/>Confidence Score<br/>Method Used]
    MotionResult --> Result
    EdgeResult --> Result
    
    Result --> Param[Apply Parameters<br/>Border Margin: 5-15%<br/>Crop Adjust: +/- pixels<br/>Start Time: Skip intro]
    
    Param --> Crop[Video Cropping<br/>ffmpeg with Audio<br/>Precise Region Extraction]
    
    Crop --> CropType{Crop Type}
    CropType --> FullVideo[Full Cropped Video<br/>Entire video with SLI only<br/>Audio Preserved]
    CropType --> Clips[Clip Segmentation<br/>5-second chunks<br/>Optional overlap]
    
    Clips --> Resize{Output Size?}
    Resize -->|Original| NoResize[Keep Original Resolution]
    Resize -->|128x128| Resize128[Resize to 128x128<br/>cv2.INTER_AREA]
    Resize -->|256x256| Resize256[Resize to 256x256<br/>cv2.INTER_AREA]
    
    NoResize --> Quality[Quality Filtering<br/>Duration Check<br/>Motion Validation<br/>Resolution Check]
    Resize128 --> Quality
    Resize256 --> Quality
    
    Quality --> QualityCheck{Passes Checks?}
    QualityCheck -->|Yes| Keep[✓ Keep Clip]
    QualityCheck -->|No| Discard[✗ Discard Clip]
    
    Keep --> Stats[Generate Statistics<br/>Total clips, duration<br/>Resolution, file size<br/>Quality metrics]
    Discard --> Stats
    
    Stats --> Preview[Create Previews<br/>Detection visualization<br/>Sample frames grid<br/>Bounding boxes overlay]
    
    Preview --> Output[Output Structure<br/>clips/ - Training data<br/>full_cropped/ - Full video<br/>previews/ - Visualizations<br/>statistics.json - Metrics]
    
    Output --> End([Dataset Ready for Training<br/>Sign Language Transcription])
    
    FullVideo --> Output
    
    style Start fill:#e1f5ff
    style Detection fill:#fff4e1
    style Border fill:#ffe1e1
    style Motion fill:#ffe1e1
    style Edge fill:#ffe1e1
    style Result fill:#e1ffe1
    style Crop fill:#f0e1ff
    style Quality fill:#ffe1f0
    style Output fill:#e1ffe1
    style End fill:#e1f5ff
